OL,3,AOne of five young men involved in
OL,4,Awrong-way crash previously pleaded
OL,5,Aguilty to assaulting police officer
OL,6,
OL,7,FSpeaking to the BBC, locals described
OL,8,Fwhat had happened as a "tragedy", with
OL,9,Fone woman saying it would "affect our
OL,10,Fwhole community"
OL,12,FThe five people travelling in the
OL,13,FPassat have been named as Michael
OL,14,FRobert Cahill, 23, Theo Rae, 17, Cole
OL,15,FRobert Worthy, 17, Jakub Matusiak, 23,
OL,16,Fand Makai Saddington, 18 - all were
OL,17,Fkilled
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/40
