OL,3,ANearly 90,000 told to evacuate as
OL,4,Awildfire approaches Reno, Nevada
OL,5,
OL,6,FNevada's Governor Joe Lombardo has
OL,7,Fdeclared a state of emergency in Washoe
OL,8,FCounty and ordered the National Guard
OL,9,Fto join firefighting and law
OL,10,Fenforcement efforts.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/40
