OL,3,AKing of Norway's health has worsened,
OL,4,Apalace says
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis son, Crown Prince Haakon, 53, has
OL,7,Fbeen serving as regent while his father
OL,8,Fis on leave.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/40
